<p class="text-navy/80 text-[17px] leading-[1.8] font-medium mb-8">
    Window cleaning with us is R50 per window, inside and out, and R80 per glass panel for folding/stacking and sliding doors. That's the easy part. The harder question for anyone within a few streets of the coast is how often you actually need to book it — because sea air does more damage to glass than most people realise.
</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-[28px] font-extrabold text-navy tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4">How window cleaning is priced</h2>
