<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-[28px] font-extrabold text-navy tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4">Working out your price</h2>
<p class="text-muted text-[15.5px] leading-[1.85] mb-5">
    Count your windows and the glass panels in any folding/stacking or sliding doors, then multiply: R50 per window and R80 per door panel. When you book a clean online, add them under the extras, enter how many you have, and the total updates as you go. For a windows-only job, request a quote with the same counts. Jobs that need rope access or scaffolding are quoted separately.
</p>

